<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian currency reserves down 4.8 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Austrian currency reserves down 4.8 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves fell 4.8 percent to 194.699 billion schillings in May, the National Bank said on Tuesday. -- Vienna newsroom +43 1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
